## Interface: 16001
## Title: BetterFishingForever
## Notes: Double right-click in the world to cast Fishing on WoW Forever, while a fishing pole is equipped. While the line is out, double right-click anywhere (or the Cast / Reel key) reels in. Shift + double right-click swaps the pole in or out. Session stats panel (casts, catches, catches/hour, skill gained, loot) and an optional loud splash mode. Optional Fishing 1-300 route with map pins and a GPS arrow. /bfish
